{"unit_id":"tag:03AT:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为范畴（category）。设<MATH_0002>为具有固定靶（target）的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中存在。链（chain）复形（complex）<MATH_0005>由上述引理<REF_0001>中的预层（presheaves）组成，在正次数（degrees）正合（exact），即同调（homology）预层（presheaves）<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>时为零。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"chain","target_term":"链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"存在所需纤维积的范畴；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶","context":"态射族的固定目标；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"构造复形的态射族；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"复形构造所需的纤维积；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"chain","target_term":"链","context":"chain complex的链结构；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"上述引理中的复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"复形各项及其同调预层；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数","context":"复形正合的次数；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"复形在正次数的正合性；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调","context":"复形的同调；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03F5:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>中的对象（object）。在引理<REF_0001>的证明中，我们已经看到<MATH_0003>作为复形（complex）同构（isomorphic）于若干复形（complexes）的直和（direct sum），它们同伦（homotopic）于<MATH_0004>（置于零次（degree））。因此，<MATH_0005>也作为复形（complex）同构（isomorphic）于若干复形（complexes）的直和（direct sum），它们同伦（homotopic）于<MATH_0006>（置于零次（degree））。也可以利用《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0002>；它适用，因为预层（presheaves）<MATH_0007>平坦（flat），而引理<REF_0003>的证明表明<MATH_0008>也是平坦（flat）预层（presheaf）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"homotopic","target_term":"同伦"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"零次"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"homotopic","target_term":"同伦"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"零次"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"逐对象检查复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"讨论同构时的复形结构；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"作为复形的同构；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"直和中的复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和","context":"取值复形的直和分解；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"homotopic","target_term":"同伦","context":"直和各复形的同伦等价；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"零次","context":"原文限定为degree zero；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用的章节标题；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"用于应用平坦性引理的预层；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"预层的平坦性；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"证明中另一个平坦预层；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
